always, I press "i" and see what I got. Pretty good items this time - a
magic marker (which I rarely get as a starting item), a blessed ?oEW,
a ?ofEA,  and the sleep spell.

After putting on my rings, I killed the lichen right next to me with my
staff, and tried to find my trusty Bonafido. Yet I had no starting pet!
Looking around the level, I found no trace of him, at all! I
immediately brought up my RGRN screen, and searched the archive for "no
starting pet", returning no results.

Whatever happened to my poor little dog named Bonafido?

